---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="servicios" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="reveal text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 mb-4">Servicios logísticos</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4"><span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to right,#fff,#94a3b8)">Soluciones para cada tipo de carga</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="reveal group rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110" style="background:rgba(34,211,238,0.1)">
            <Icon name="box" width={28} height={28} class="text-cyan-400" />
          </div>
          <div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Carga Palletizada</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">Pallets estándar y personalizados. Embalaje industrial y protección marítima.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">EUR pallet</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">USD pallet</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Custom</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal group rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110" style="background:rgba(34,211,238,0.1)">
            <Icon name="container" width={28} height={28} class="text-cyan-400" />
          </div>
          <div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Contenedores FCL</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">Contenedores completos 20' y 40'. Carga sellada de origen a destino.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">20' Standard</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">40' High Cube</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Reefer</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal group rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/30 transition-all" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110" style="background:rgba(20,184,166,0.1)">
            <Icon name="package" width={28} height={28} class="text-teal-400" />
          </div>
          <div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Carga Fraccionada LCL</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">Consolidamos tu carga con otros envíos. Pagás solo por el espacio que usás.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Desde 1 m³</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Consolidado semanal</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal group rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-5">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110" style="background:rgba(34,211,238,0.1)">
            <Icon name="warehouse" width={28} height={28} class="text-cyan-400" />
          </div>
          <div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Almacenaje & Última Milla</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">Bodega propia en Hanga Roa con inventario online. Distribución local.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Bodega 800m²</span><span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-slate-400">Inventario online</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
